  "caveats": [
    "Honest hits & misses: (1) Sweedler 4-hop rate G_F*m_p^2 = (q0^2 - 1)^8 misses PDG G_F by -18.12% (+10.51% on v_EW = 272.10 GeV) at tree level, while the amplitude-squared reading G_F*m_p^2 = (q0^2 - 1)^4 gives v_EW = 14.65 GeV (-94.05% miss at m_model = m_p); however, inserting parameter-free kappa_S = 2^(1/4)*(q0^2 - 1)^4 into the 1-loop Habiro slot of EwVevGaps escapes su2_coupling_not_selfConsistent (< 1/30) and lands at +81.13 ppb (+0.32 sigma) vs PDG v_EW (still conditional on T_EW's 3 open slots). (2) Low Sweedler threshold mu_UV/M_Z = (q0^2 - 1)^(-4) (L = 5.843) only runs sin^2 theta_W from 0.375 to 0.3420 (2-loop, +47.9% above 0.23122), whereas matching sin^2 theta_W(M_Z) = 0.23122 requires L* = 25.45 (1-loop, k_eff = 17.42) / ~25.33 (2-loop, straddled by k = 17 and k = 18), where single-step minimal-SM unification undershoots alpha_s(M_Z) (~0.071-0.074 vs 0.1180) because smTriangleInv = -1217.03 != 0; thresholds L >= 35 (k = 24, 12*pi) hit the 2-loop QCD Landau pole above M_Z. (3) Conversely, the zero-parameter IR QCD dimensional-transmutation scale Lambda = m_p*(q0^2 - 1) = 217.73 MeV gives 2-loop alpha_s(M_Z) = 0.11849 (+0.41%, +0.54 sigma vs PDG 0.1180 +/- 0.0009; 0.11825 / +0.27 sigma using QOU's own torus M_Z)."
